    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vqQUYYEmg/\" target=\"_blank\">超级超级超级超级超级讨厌</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd885be84d32fbfa4328a59cb40cb47034ec18e6.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rJW3zkEYU/\" target=\"_blank\">宽慰</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d1f2a825a7436f80c51353b227f8a19ca8988043.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411W7uR/\" target=\"_blank\">妄想感伤代偿联盟</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5dedb17c6dd8c7cd35b3c34ebe24c269efbb50f0.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EBH8zsE1o/\" target=\"_blank\">狸猫之舞</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/083df0a23565c22fb0da86d356aaaf8d50691761.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ERHBz1E74/\" target=\"_blank\">天雨之女</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f59571d639b29c36765502af0a47a6a0a1ea663d.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VybNzfECt/\" target=\"_blank\">选哪个</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4e041751f24920c82921791205f1ac1b64e1a4f3.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GJeHzUEEM/\" target=\"_blank\">术然散于风</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6482b76dc3301bf77724a70c7e9737ebdb6c8453.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1k6YPz7EaW/\" target=\"_blank\">红丝绒起义</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/be194fa6e0a68665cea